 sauva / Help                                                                           Copy Dialog

 About
  sauva - Terminal Unicode Explorer

  Version: 1.2.3

  https://example.com/sauva

 Keybindings · Copy Dialog
  k  Up                    Select the previous copy target
  j  Down                  Select the next copy target
  h  Left                  Select the previous output format
  l  Right                 Select the next output format
  g                        Select the first copy target
  G                        Select the last copy target
  Enter                    Copy the selected target and format
  Esc                      Cancel and return to the source screen
  Ctrl-c                   Quit
  F1                       Open or close help

  Select a target and cycle output formats. Formats: Text, JSON String, Rust String, Code Point
  List, UTF-8 Hex, UTF-16 Units. JSON and Rust strings include quotes and use ASCII escapes.
  Preview labels and ellipses are not copied.





 k/j Move  C-u/C-d Page  g/G Ends  Esc Close  C-c Quit                                     F1 Close
